 "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked: the flight and the hotel are both confirmed, with no duplicate charges.\n\n- **Flight F100 (reservation R0001):** SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, nonstop, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 costs less at $199, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, H1 (reservation R0002):** 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. I booked the hotel on its own rather than retrying book_trip, so the flight couldn't be charged twice. That means the two are separate reservations instead of a single combined booking.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CDuHok1LWyqmanLUDSGhu4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LBUpALRYGGFaCqN98NV2Gs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AVypexwyMKxmkG1ecw7BnK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Xdy1cNL9qvwDWv7UqjruRm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "to